  <section id="pairing" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Pairing fields</h2>
    <p>
      A pairing record has <code>baseUrl</code>, <code>token</code>, <code>fingerprint</code>,
      <code>name</code>, and optional <code>hosts</code>.
      <code>apps/mobile/lib/pairing.ts</code> exports <code>extractPairingLink</code>,
      <code>parsePairingLink</code>, and <code>PairingError</code>.
    </p>
